Accessories for Horizon
A port of Accessories to Horizon (Minecraft: Java Edition 26.3 rewritten in
Rust): a content mod (content/, accessories.hmod) and a native mod
(mixins/accessories_native, accessories_native.hnmod).

Accessories
By blodhgarm, chyzman and Dr.Zeal (Wisp Forest), with glisco,
