The content mod's textures, nine-patch definitions, slot, group and entity
data, tags and language files are the original's own
(common/src/main/resources), copied by tools/content.mjs; owo-lib's rich
text values in the language files are turned into plain strings. The icon in
mixins/accessories_native/data/icon.png is the original's
(fabric/src/main/resources/assets/accessories/icon.png).

This port, by DispatchedToHeaven and DeportedToHell, rewrites the mod's slot
loading, containers, menu, screen, default renderer and death handling in Rust
for Horizon's native mod API. It is not affiliated with Wisp Forest, Mojang or
Microsoft.
